1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:01,690
(Leonard:)What did you do?

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,810
(Leonard:)I don't know.

3
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:08,850
(Howard:)Huh. I just got called
into Human Resources.

4
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,170
(Penny:)Why?

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,090
I don't know. Heh.

6
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:17,410
(Raj:)Huh. That is so strange. Human Resources
wants to talk to me tomorrow.

7
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:21,090
(Raj:)Could you stop licking your ass
for two minutes? I have a problem here.

8
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,370
(Howard:)Do you really think
you should be drinking right now?

9
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:38,250
(Raj:)How else am I supposed to talk
to the human resources lady?

10
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,930
(Howard:)I don't know, seek professional help?

11
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:45,320
(Raj:)I did. The guy at the liquor store said
this stuff tastes great in coffee.

12
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:50,330
(Howard:)You got called in too? What is going on?

13
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:52,370
(Leonard:)Sheldon threw us all under the bus.

14
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:55,050
(Raj:)I feel like I've been called
to the principal's office.

15
00:00:55,240 --> 00:01:00,020
(Raj:)Although I wouldn't mind
if Brown Sugar suspended me...

